window.products.push({"id":787048,"name":"Max & Lily Bunk Bed, L Shape Twin-Over-Full Bed Frame For Kids With Bookcase and Desk, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":919.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I8m-bi6CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Plenty of room for sleep, study and play? Now that’s a win-win! The Max & Lily Twin Over Full L-Shape Bunk Bed with Bookcase & Desk is the perfect combination of functional and fun that both kids and parents love. Top bunk features tall 14” guardrails for extra sleep security up high. For best fit and safety, we recommend using a 5-inch mattress, and not exceeding an 8-inch mattress. Lower bed is not attached to the top bed and can be moved independently. Compact desk creates a space-saving area for homework and crafts. Desk can be attached underneath or on the outside of the bed, and should not be used as a standalone desk. Practical storage shelves give you the space to organize all your toys, books and school essentials. Angled ladder with wide anti-slip steps offers comfortable, easy climbing. Added bonus - ladder and shelves are both reversible upon assembly, so they fit great in any space. All Max & Lily products use a durable, low VOC finish. The slatted head and footboards and flush, color-matched hardware give this bunk bed a clean, modern look. Instructions, upper/lower slat rolls, and required hardware are included. Constructed with solid, knot-free New Zealand pine wood for long-lasting strength and sturdiness. With solid plywood slats and a metal support bar, each sleeping surface can support 400 pounds of resting weight. This bed meets or exceeds Federal safety standards for kids furniture. When it’s time for play, this bunk bed’s space saving design frees up plenty of floor space by stacking two sleeping surfaces. 2+ adults make assembly simple and easy. The Twin Over Full L-Shape Bunk Bed with Bookcase & Desk from Max & Lily offers exceptional quality and affordability that kids and their parents will enjoy for years to come. Max & Lily is a member of the Maxwood family of brands - the kids furniture experts bringing a tradition of superior quality, safety and fun!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I8m-bi6CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Max & Lily","source_asin":"B0B2PRSZ5L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-787048","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2PRSZ5L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2PRSZ5L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
