window.products.push({"id":787117,"name":"Double love birds wine box for two bottles for your wedding or anniversary Personalized for you","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":98.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91dm5r4az8L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"This box is handcrafted and made at the time of ordering. Everything on the box is hand engraved with a professional pyrography tool and is not laser engraved. The box that is pictured is just an example of one of the designs that I've done. I can do just about anything on this box that you would like. If you would prefer a design from my single wine boxes, just let me know which one and I will make it work on this double wine box. Just let me know what you want and if it is reasonable, I can do it :) This box is very versatile. Please see additional photos for options. You can use it for two bottles of wine, one bottle of wine and two stemless wine glasses or you can remove the inserts and use it as a card box. After your order is placed, I will send you a computer proof of what your design will look like. Please respond to that message as quickly as possible so that I can add you to my production schedule. If edits are required after proof is initially sent, that is not a problem! I will do as many as you need so you are completely satisfied with the design of your box. Once final approval of the design is given, no other edits will be accepted because I start on your box immediately after your approval. Thank you for looking at my items! I hope you enjoy them as much as I enjoy making them.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91dm5r4az8L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ArrowSarah","source_asin":"B01786MDMG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-787117","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01786MDMG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01786MDMG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
