window.products.push({"id":787137,"name":"Tabiger Drop Front Shoe Boxes, Hard Clear Plastic Stackable Shoe Box Storage Containers with Magnetic Acrylic Door, Sneaker Shoe Containers, Shoe Stor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F39tzvWXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"9 LARGE SHOE ORGANIZERS MEET ALL YOUR STORAGE NEEDS AND TIDY YOUR ROOM: With all types of shoes in mind, the 13.4\" x 10.6\" x 7.4\" overall assembly size provide plenty of storage space fits women's shoes up to size 13 and men's shoes up to size 12, perfect for storing all kinds of high heels, high-top shoes, sneakers, casual shoes, canvas shoes. Besides, it's also an ideal solution to store cosmetics, toys, clothing, hat, etc DISPLAY AND EASY IDENTIFICATION OF YOUR SHOES: With a large, highly transparent acrylic door and clear PP body, all your collection will be always displayed perfectly. You'll be able to target the right shoes at a glance without opening all the boxes MAGNETIC SHOE BOX WITH PREMIUM MATERIAL AND STURDY STRUCTURE: The door is specially made of acrylic, which is more transparent than plastic, there are 2 magnets installed on the door to prevent stuff from falling out when moving the shoe box, and easier to take out or put in your shoes. The hard plastic body provides a sturdy support structure without deformation, ensuring years of use. Besides, these shoe storage bins are washable and easy to wipe clean, say goodbye to dusty or dirty box STACKABLE DESIGN AND DIY SHOE STORAGE BOXES: Plastic sneaker containers can be stably stacked by including small cylinders without falling. And they can be combined in any shape according to your placing needs, hallway, living room, wardrobe, closet or even under your bed. Get them now and design your own display case and enjoy the DIY process! FAST SET UP AND SWEET SERVICE: The slot design on the panels makes assemble progress fast and easy, came with step-by-step clear instructions, and you will get 24/7 customer service for these sneaker storage boxes. Should you have any doubts or questions, please feel free to contact us and you’ll get a prompt reply within 24 hours","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F39tzvWXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tabiger","source_asin":"B09NR48TVX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-787137","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NR48TVX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NR48TVX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":787138,"name":"Russian Piping Tips 8 Pcs/Set, Messar Stainless Steel Russian Piping Ball Tips Frosting Icing Piping Nozzles Set Flower Cake Decorating Tips Kit for D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rLr2WzxkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features: Our russian piping ball tips are made of food grade 304 stainless steel material, seamless welding technology to make, which are exceptionally strong, durable and easy to clean, safe for dish washer.  Just squeeze on your icing bag gently (not included), it will produce frosting from the cake decoration tip and you can create an entire gorgeous flower bud in full bloom.   You'll have everything you need to start decorating your cakes, muffins, cupcakes cookies, desserts and pastry with a professional touch.  You can make beautiful butter cream flowers easily with russian piping nozzles set, such as tulips, roses, and drop flowers etc.  Icing Tips Using Introduction: 1. Wash the cake decoration tips in hot water. 2. Prepare the piping bag cutting so that 1-2 mm of nozzle can pop out of piping bag. 3. Insert the cake piping nozzle in the bag. 4. Put the buttercream in a bag. Buttercream must be firm, room temperature, not too soft. 5. Place the icing nozzle to the cupcake/cake base,while squeezing gently, life nozzle. 6. If the buttercream is too soft the buds will be closed.Pop in the fridge,if necessary. 7. After use,wash in hot soap water and dry.  Specifications: Material: 304 stainless steel Size: 6.2x3.3cm Color: silver Quatity: 8 pcs Christmas Birthdays Anniversary Wedding DIY Icing Nozzle Tool  Package Included: 8 x Russian Icing Tips for Cake Decoration  Warm Notice: Before using, please wash the icing nozzles, put them in hot water for a minute or more. Fill the piping bag with butter cream that is at room temperature, not too soft or too firm. Squeeze gently to create a base for the flower and then pull away by 1-2cm to form your flower. After using, we recommend using detergent to clean the icing piping tips inside and outside, put them in hot water for a minute and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rLr2WzxkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Decoo","source_asin":"B07SC2CPQS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-787138","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SC2CPQS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SC2CPQS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
