window.products.push({"id":787263,"name":"GMHome 50 Inches Wall Recessed Electric Fireplace Wall Mounted Heater Log Set & Crystal, 9 Changeable Colors, with Remote, 1500W Fireplace, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618quNrbNyL._AC_SL1492_.jpg","description":"TWO OPTIONS EMBER BED：This wall recessed electric fireplace equipped with both Log sets & Crystals to create an authentic feel & bring interesting DIY assembly. Different ember bed and flame color to match your mood. Gorgeous realistic dancing flames create an amazing ambiance when have party and family gathering in your home. NINE COLORS OF REALISTIC FLAME EFFECT: Realistic log set &crystal flame effect for perfect ambiance with up to 9 changeable flame color (yellow, green, blue, white, yellow & green, yellow & blue, yellow & white, green & blue, green & white). Adjustable flame brightness-5 setting, from a soft ember glow to a full blazing brightness. ELEGANT TIDY & MODERN FIREPLACE WITH TWO INSTALLATION CHOICES: Front face heat vent allows both flush in-wall recessed and on-wall mounted installation. Black glass panel add a tidy and modern look to your room. Ideal fireplace for living room, bedroom, and office both for warmth and ambiance. TWO HEAT SETTINGS / REMOTE & PANEL CONTROL BOTH OK: Flame effect can be operated with or without heat. Fits for room up to 400 sq ft. 1500W / 5,100 BTU's, high in freeing cold weather and low in not so cold season. All year round ambiances. Enjoy convenient Remote Control for power, color, heat, temperature, timer and so on. ONE YEAR WARRANTY & HASSLE-FREE INSTALLATION: CETL certified, Safety cut-off device for overheat protection, safe for kids and pets; Easy & quick installation, step-by-step instructions provided.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618quNrbNyL._AC_SL1492_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GMHome","source_asin":"B07H3M56VS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-787263","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H3M56VS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H3M56VS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":787264,"name":"Fashion Bed Group Dunhill Complete Bed with Wood Sleigh Style Frame and Autumn Brown Metal Swirling Scrolls, Honey Oak Finish, Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K37-wkIQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Dunhill is a standout among mixed media beds, with transitional styling in a sleigh design that will take the focal point of any master suite or guestroom, while complementing almost any décor. Constructed of solid wood for stability and years of everyday use, the 50-inch headboard and 34.25-inch footboard have a rich 9-step Honey Oak wood finish to provide class and sophistication for the formal bedroom, but also warmth and serenity for a more casual atmosphere. The soft Autumn Brown finished swirling metal scrolls are the perfect blend of light and dark, soft and dramatic. Comfort and beauty surround you when you introduce this bed to your current lifestyle. The engineered bed frame consists of iron rails, cross arms and glides to provide full support to your mattress and box spring. A good ornamental bed, like the Dunhill, will fuse with the surrounding décor, accent other bedroom furniture and transform an ordinary room into something interesting and sophisticated. This unit includes a headboard and footboard panel, bed frame, instruction sheet, and hardware bag with everything needed for easy assembly. The Leggett & Platt Dunhill Complete Bed comes with a 10-year limited warranty against manufacturing defects. Leggett & Platt Inc. is an industry leader in the production of adjustable bases, fashionable beds, bedding support, and top of bed textiles. By keeping a close eye on the design community and other fashion and decorating sources, Leggett & Platt stays on top of the trends and knows the right mix of finishes, innovative designs, and technology to continually provide quality crafted products at an exceptional value. Leggett & Platt Consumer Products: Value Without Compromise","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K37-wkIQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashion Bed Group","source_asin":"B007L6R90A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-787264","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007L6R90A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007L6R90A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
