window.products.push({"id":787459,"name":"Warebest 16-Piece Stoneware Dinnerware Set of 4,Spanish/Mexican Floral Design, Ceramic Tableware Service for 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GSg7wcAeL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Ceramic 16-piece Dinnerware Sets Service for 4Includes Each of: 4pcs 10.5”dinner plates, 4pcs 7”dessert plates, 4pcs 21oz soup bowls and 4pcs 12oz mug. We are Direct Manufacturer and specialized in various kinds of stoneware/dolomite/porcelain ceramic dinnerware,mug, bowl, plate, promotion gift etc. Dinnerware is one of those home essentials you don't think too much about until you need a new set. Then, when you do, it can be overwhelming to decide between materials, patterns, size, shape, and number of place settings. If you want a quality dinnerware set that will last you years to come, you can choose our four types of tableware. (LIke this : B07CFWV2SM, B07Q28JQN3, B07PRXP387, B07PN2FNYN) Traditionally, formal dinnerware sets were for entertaining, whereas casual dinnerware sets were for daily use. Today, it's uncommon to have separate formal and casual dinnerware, We mainly sell and produce daily casual dinnerware. Dinnerware set materials Dinnerware sets can be found in a range of materials, but the three most common are stoneware, porcelain, and bone china.----We use an economical and beautiful stoneware material.Stoneware dinnerware tends to be found in a wider range of colors, usually with bolder options and various glazes, both shiny and matte.  Stoneware Stoneware is a type of ceramic made from unrefined clay fired at a very high temperature. It's thicker and sturdier than porcelain and bone china. Pros: Fairly strong and chip-resistant, can be finished with a with a wide range of glazes in various colors and textures, generally dishwasher safe and microwavable, more affordable than fine china. Size Size matters when choosing a dinnerware set. We recommend measuring the depth and width of the cupboard in which you intend to keep your dinnerware.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GSg7wcAeL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Warebest","source_asin":"B07PQ5S2VC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-787459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PQ5S2VC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PQ5S2VC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
