window.products.push({"id":787694,"name":"Elviros Cervical Memory Foam Pillow, 2 in 1 Contour Orthopedic Support Pillows for Neck Pain, Adjustable Ergonomic Bed Pillow for Side, Back and Stoma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GdYCfkPtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌙ADJUSTABLE SOFTNESS/FIRMNESS: This cervical pillow is designed with two replaceable memory foam inserts (about 1.18\" thick). If you are used to sleeping on soft pillow,use the blue insert to fit the pillow, and the other yellow insert is more suitable for people who sleep on hard pillow. This gives you more options to enjoy a softer or firmer pillow. 🌙2 IN 1 MULTI-FUNCTIONAL DESIGN: Combines neck pillow and bed pillow in one, which means you buy 2 types of pillows at once. Back sleepers with cervical issues can sleep on the higher side (4.9\" ), as this side provides better support for the head and cervical, keeping the neck aligned with body. The other lower side (3.35\" )conforms to the natural curve of the body,and fits for most of sleepers. 🌙ERGONOMIC CONTOUR DESIGN: Contour area keeps your neck at the right height and provides excellent support during sleep.Central cavity keeps the head comfortably in the middle, maintains good blood flow and allows you to breathe more freely.What‘s more, butterfly shape provides a special armrest for your arm to relieve numbness. These thoughtful designs are all designed to ensure you have a peaceful and comfortable sleep every night. 🌙RELIEVE NECK & SHOULDER PAIN: Elviros orthopedic pillow is designed to provide natural spinal support for the body, and increase isolated pressure distribution for full muscle relaxation. Long-term use can also improve sleep posture and prevent neck and shoulder pain. Whether you're a side sleeper, back sleeper or stomach sleeper, our neck pillow will help you sleep pain-free through the night and wake up feeling refreshed and energized. 🌙SAFE & PREMIUM MEMORY FOAM: Our neck support pillow is CertiPUR-US and Oeko-Tex certified. Made of high-density slow-rebound memory foam which rebounds gently in 3 to 5 seconds, and can intelligently adjusts its firmness by sensing body temperature, making the pillow with support and comfort function. All materials are chemical-free for improved health. 🌙REMOVABLE BREATHABLE PILLOWCASE: The pillowcase is made of skin-friendly polyester fiber, which facilitates air circulation and gives you a comfortable and cool sleeping environment. And it's removable and machine washable for easy cleaning. This is a great gift for yourself,family and friends. If you encounter any problems during use, please feel free to contact us. We will provide you with a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GdYCfkPtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elviros","source_asin":"B0BN3GF835","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-787694","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN3GF835","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN3GF835","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
