window.products.push({"id":787716,"name":"Chefo Salt and Pepper Grinder Set with Adjustable ceramic Coarseness and Matching Stand, Crystal Glass & Brushed Stainless Steel Pepper shaker Mill, N","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UAU6VdwhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔ HIGH QUALITY GLASS | MADERN DESIGN These salt and pepper shakers are made of high quality glass and a brushed silver stainless steel cap, which feature a modern design and are stylish and elegant for kitchen-to-table use! Producing a durable blend of elegance and function with exquisite modern look. We understand that kitchen tools should be both functionally and elegantly designed. ✔ EASY REFILLING FOR NO MESS - Maintains the shelf life and freshness of the spices. This easy-to-use Snap-On cap is crafted for practical everyday use.no need constantly refill with high capacity, this set is the perfect size to cut down on constant refills without being bulky. When you do have to refill, the clear glass bodies will let you know when it's time! The stainless steel top easily screws off revealing a wide opening for easy and mess free refills. ✔ SPICE UP YOUR MENU FRESHLY LIKE A CULINARY ARTIST with freshly ground spices to produce savory seasoning during meal preparation. Stimulate taste buds at the table with a final garnish from these premium salt and pepper grinders. Ensuring salt and pepper ends up only on your food -- not all over your table, the stainless steel set will compliment any kitchen style. ✔ FREE BONUS! STAINLESS STEEL STAND - Each set includes a matching stainless steel table stand that allows you to store and display your new salt and pepper grinder, this simple design brings elegance and style to any type of kitchen / dining table.+ Wooden cleaning brush. This allows you to clean grinder easily with no mass ✔ 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED!! - We're SO confident that you'll love this Grinder set that it's backed by our 100% Money Back Guarantee. If you don't love it - *for whatever reason* - we'll replace it or give you back every cent. \"No questions asked\" That means you'll love it, or it's free! click on the \"Add To Cart\" Button NOW >>>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UAU6VdwhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cheffco","source_asin":"B01LZAQFTU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-787716","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LZAQFTU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LZAQFTU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
