window.products.push({"id":787779,"name":"Ribbed Coupe Cocktail Glasses 8 oz | Set of 2 | Classic Manhattan Glasses For Cocktails, Champagne Coupe, Ripple Coupe Glasses, Art Deco Gatsby Vintag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Mgw59+W2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This set of four gold rim ribbed glasses are perfect for toasting your favorite drinks. The ripple ribbed design serves as a fun and unique way to dress up your bar or entertaining space. Enjoy these glasses with friends while celebrating any occasion, or simply use them everyday in the comfort of your own home. Enhance your overall home decor with these elegant glasses. With their gold-rim accent, they can be used for any occasion, including anniversaries, weddings and all sorts of parties. Unleash your inner mixologist by adding these Ripple Ribbed Gold-Rim Glasses to your bar. The ripple effect on these glasses makes them irresistible, a conversation starter set to say the least! Enjoy a refreshing mimosa or prosecco cocktail with your brunch guests or entertain in style with a refined wine tasting experience. Add a touch of sophistication to your home bar with the Cocktail Coupe Goblet Glasses. Each glass has a height of 5.5\", a diameter of 4\", and a capacity of 8 ounces. Celebrate your favorite guests in style with the charmingly elegant Cocktail Coupe Goblet Glasses Set of 4. Whether you'd rather drink or just enjoy the sight of fresh squeezed juices or champagnes floating in the glass, the Coupe Goblet Glasses set is sure to impress. The ripple texture emphasizes the beauty of the glass and makes an impactful impression. This is the perfect gift to yourself. This set of four glasses will be your favorite housewarming gift, or wedding gift. The Wine Savant Ripple Ribbed Coupe Glasses are perfect for any bar, home, or wine tasting event. Our coupe glasses are elegantly simple with a refined shape. This oversize glass allows more room for shaking & stirring, making it perfect for creative cocktail craft, enjoying champagne, or even old fashioned drinks without leaving any room on the rim. Each glass is mouth-blown & handcrafted using traditional techniques, adding unique character to each piece. Serve up a little ambiance with this beautiful cocktail glass set designed to highlight your favorite bubbly. With a canted bowl and flared bottom, these stemless glasses allow the mixing and swirling of liquors and juices in drinks, offering a wide opening for aromas to be expelled. Perfect for fine dining or entertaining in the comfort of your own home, these elegant glasses add a bit of class and sophistication to your parties and dinner dates.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Mgw59+W2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Wine Savant","source_asin":"B0C7JHKDR5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-787779","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7JHKDR5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7JHKDR5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
